d from the queue due to expiration"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isEmpty"},{"type":"text","value":": Whether the queuer has no items to process (items array is empty)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isFull"},{"type":"text","value":": Whether the queuer has reached its maximum capacity"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isIdle"},{"type":"text","value":": Whether the queuer is not currently processing any items"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isRunning"},{"type":"text","value":": Whether the queuer is active and will process items automatically"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"items"},{"type":"text","value":": Array of items currently waiting to be processed"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"itemTimestamps"},{"type":"text","value":": Timestamps when items were added to the queue for expiration tracking"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pendingTick"},{"type":"text","value":": Whether the queuer has a pending timeout for processing the next item"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rejectionCount"},{"type":"text","value":": Number of items that have been rejected from being added to the queue"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"size"},{"type":"text","value":": Number of items currently in the queue"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"status"},{"type":"text","value":": Current processing status - 'idle' when not processing, 'running' when active, 'stopped' when paused"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"options-and-ownership","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options and ownership"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tracked named arguments update options after rendering. createPacerScope supplies shared\ndefaults through contextual helpers. Local named options override those defaults.\nRemoving the helper invocation calls stop().\nonUnmount replaces default cleanup and receives the same adapter instance. A custom callback\nmust perform all required cleanup. Use flush() where supported to finish pending work."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { on } from '@ember/modifier'\nimport { fn } from '@ember/helper'\nimport { useQueuer } from '@tanstack/ember-pacer'\nimport type { QueuerState } from '@tanstack/ember-pacer'\n\nconst select = (state: QueuerState<string>) => ({ size: state.size })\n\n<template>\n  {{#let (useQueuer @process select wait=100) as |utility|}}\n    <button {{on \"click\" (fn utility.addItem \"item\")}}>Schedule</button>\n    <span>{{utility.state.size}}</span>\n  {{/let}}\n</template>","lang":"gts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"extends","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extends"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"default"},{"type":"text","value":"<{\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Args"},{"type":"text","value":": {\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Named"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/EmberQueuerOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EmberQueuerOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":">;\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Positional"},{"type":"text","value":": [("},{"